<div class="component-demo">
  <h3>🗄️ Menu Latéral (Sidebar)</h3>
  <p class="text-muted mb-4">
    Panneau de navigation latéral fixe. Il gère un état ouvert/fermé (`.show`) sur mobile, et peut être figé en permanence sur Desktop avec `.sidebar-expand-*`.
  </p>

  <div class="row g-4 mb-5">
    <div class="col-12 text-center py-5 box box-secondary mb-0">
      
      <p class="mb-4">Le menu latéral (Sidebar) est un élément structurel fixe (<code>position: fixed</code>). Pour ne pas casser l'affichage de cette page de documentation, utilisez le bouton ci-dessous pour tester son apparition.</p>
      
      <button class="btn btn-primary" data-ds-toggle="sidebar" data-ds-target="#demoSidebar">
        <i class="ri-layout-left-line"></i> Ouvrir la Sidebar de démo
      </button>

    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-4">
    <h5>Code d'exemple</h5>
    {% set codeExample %}
<div class="dashboard-overlay" data-ds-dismiss="sidebar" data-ds-target="#mySidebar"></div>

<aside class="sidebar sidebar-expand-lg" id="mySidebar">
  
  <div class="sidebar-header">
    <a href="#" class="sidebar-brand fw-bold fs-5">
      <i class="ri-box-3-fill text-primary"></i> App Name
    </a>
  </div>

  <div class="sidebar-content">
    <div class="sidebar-item">
      <a href="#" class="sidebar-link active">
        <i class="ri-dashboard-line"></i>
        <span>Dashboard</span>
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="sidebar-item">
      <a href="#" class="sidebar-link">
        <i class="ri-user-settings-line"></i>
        <span>Utilisateurs</span>
        <span class="badge bg-primary-subtle text-primary-dark rounded-pill sidebar-badge">Nouveau</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="sidebar-footer">
    </div>

</aside>
    {% endset %}
    {% include 'fragments/components/_code-block.html.twig' with {
      'code': codeExample,
      'language': 'html',
      'title': 'Structure HTML Sidebar'
    } %}
  </div>
</div>

{# --- LA SIDEBAR CACHÉE POUR LA DÉMO CI-DESSUS --- #}

<div class="dashboard-overlay" data-ds-dismiss="sidebar" data-ds-target="#demoSidebar" style="position: fixed; inset: 0; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.5); z-index: 1030; opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; transition: opacity 0.3s ease;"></div>

<aside class="sidebar" id="demoSidebar" style="z-index: 1040;">
  <div class="sidebar-header">
    <a href="#" class="sidebar-brand fw-bold fs-5">
      <i class="ri-box-3-fill text-primary"></i> UI Kit
    </a>
  </div>

  <div class="sidebar-content">
    <p class="text-muted small fw-bold px-3 mb-2 mt-3">Général</p>
    <div class="sidebar-item">
      <a href="#" class="sidebar-link active">
        <i class="ri-dashboard-line"></i>
        <span>Vue d'ensemble</span>
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="sidebar-item">
      <a href="#" class="sidebar-link">
        <i class="ri-bar-chart-box-line"></i>
        <span>Analyses</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <p class="text-muted small fw-bold px-3 mb-2 mt-4">Système</p>
    <div class="sidebar-item">
      <a href="#" class="sidebar-link">
        <i class="ri-settings-4-line"></i>
        <span>Paramètres</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="sidebar-footer">
    <button class="btn btn-ghost-danger w-100" data-ds-dismiss="sidebar" data-ds-target="#demoSidebar">
      Fermer la démo
    </button>
  </div>
</aside>

{# Petit fix inline rapide pour faire fonctionner l'overlay de démo sans toucher au CSS global #}
<style>
  .dashboard-overlay.is-visible {
    opacity: 1 !important;
    pointer-events: auto !important;
  }
</style>